```bash
aim@aim-PowerEdge-T620:~/.config/oxide$ oxide silo utilization help

Usage: oxide silo utilization [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List current utilization state for all silos
  view  Fetch current utilization for given silo
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>  Configuration profile to use for commands
```